00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.778
instantly turn into snow and ice.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:13.213
But photographer

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:16.149
Joe Chowaniec of Alberta, Canada,

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.450
