00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:30.263
Cold enough to beat a frozen shirt

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.232
like a drum

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.535
to turn genes into a battering ram.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.070
So Joe decided

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.205
to do his own game of you, froze

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.540
your one off.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.476
The next one was the plate of ramen

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:44.310
noodles.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.678
In 60 seconds,

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.314
the boiled noodles were frozen stiff

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.783
and frozen in time.

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:51.017
The Frozen in Time series,

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:52.185
I guess I'm calling it

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:53.953
the next experiment, involve

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.089
